1867.             if `firsttimethrough' == 1 & ("`sghaspre'" == "yes" | "`round'" == "cont") matrix `wdid_sg`sgcase'' = ( `___`processedobject''[`truerow',1..6],.)
1868.             if `firsttimethrough' == 0 & ("`sghaspre'" == "yes" | "`round'" == "cont") matrix `wdid_sg`sgcase'' = `wdid_sg`sgcase'' \  ( `___`processedobject''[`truerow',1..6],.)
1869.             * record, in (round x object) order, whether this non-ES row was appended, so the
.             * rowname filter below can name exactly the rows that exist (see the note there)
