 46.   if "`contreatelasticitytype'" == "eyex" local elasinj `elasinj' Marginal Treatment Effects Presented as Elasticities
 47.   if "`contreatelasticitytype'" == "eydx" local elasinj `elasinj' Marginal Treatment Effects Presented as Semi-elasticities (eydx)
